# The format of this file is identical to `.dockerignore`.
# It is used to reduce the size of deployed images to make the process of publishing faster.

# No need to store the pnpm store twice.
.local

# --- Publish image slimming -------------------------------------------------
# The Repl layer push is the slowest step of a publish (~5 minutes) and has
# timed out before. Nothing below is read at build time or at runtime, so
# keeping it out of the image shortens that push.

# Git history — never needed by the build or the running server.
.git

# Local tool/build caches, rebuilt on the deploy machine.
.cache

# Uploaded working files; no source or script references them.
attached_assets

# Raw Squarespace scrape. Only clone-data/extracted/*.json is imported by the
# site (src/data/blogs.ts, src/data/pages.ts); the rest is reference material.
clone-data/blogs
clone-data/pages
clone-data/images

# Research notes and kit archives — documentation, not shipped code.
research
*.zip
